{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 132,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, remember David and all his affliction,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你记念所受的一切苦难！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你記念所受的一切苦難！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "how he swore to the LORD, and vowed to the Mighty One of Jacob:",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他怎样向耶和华起誓， 的大能者许愿，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他怎樣向耶和華起誓， 的大能者許願，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Surely I will not come into the structure of my house, go up into my bed;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "说：我必不进我的帐幕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "說：我必不進我的帳幕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will not give sleep to my eyes, slumber to my eyelids,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我不容我的眼睛睡觉，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我不容我的眼睛睡覺，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "until I find out a place for the LORD, a dwelling for the Mighty One of Jacob.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "直等我为耶和华寻得所在， 的大能者寻得居所。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "直等我為耶和華尋得所在， 的大能者尋得居所。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Behold, we heard of it in Ephrathah. We found it in the field of Jaar.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们听说在， 就寻见了。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們聽說在， 就尋見了。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "“We will go into his dwelling place. will worship at his footstool.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们要进他的居所，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們要進他的居所，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Arise, LORD, into your resting place, you, and the ark of your strength.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你兴起， 柜同入安息之所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你興起， 櫃同入安息之所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let your priests be clothed with righteousness. saints shout for joy!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿你的祭司披上公义！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願你的祭司披上公義！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "For your servant David’s sake, turn away the face of your anointed one.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你因你仆人的缘故，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你因你僕人的緣故，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD has sworn to David in truth. He will not turn from it: I will set the fruit of your body on your throne.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华向、凭诚实起了誓， ：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華向、憑誠實起了誓， ：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "If your children will keep my covenant, my testimony that I will teach them, their children also will sit on your throne forever more.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你的众子若守我的约",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你的眾子若守我的約",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "For the LORD has chosen Zion. He has desired it for his habitation.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为耶和华拣选了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為耶和華揀選了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "“This is my resting place forever. I will live here, for I have desired it.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "说：这是我永远安息之所；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "說：這是我永遠安息之所；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will abundantly bless her provision. I will satisfy her poor with bread.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要使其中的粮食丰满，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要使其中的糧食豐滿，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will also clothe her priests with salvation. Her saints will shout aloud for joy.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要使祭司披上救恩，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要使祭司披上救恩，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will make the horn of David to bud there. I have ordained a lamp for my anointed.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要叫的角在那里发生；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要叫的角在那裏發生；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will clothe his enemies with shame, but on himself, his crown will shine.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要使他的仇敌披上羞耻；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要使他的仇敵披上羞恥；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}